{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40237","headline":"路泊富春寄友人 · 喻坦之","name":"路泊富春寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江钟寒夕微，江鸟望巢飞。\n木落山城出，潮生海棹归。\n独吟霜岛月，谁寄雪天衣。\n此别三千里，关西信更稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻坦之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}